  "id": "incomplete-factorial-design",
  "term": "incomplete factorial design",
  "definition": "An incomplete factorial design is a factorial study setup in which some combinations of the variables being studied are not included. Because not all factor combinations are available, analysis is limited to the effects and interactions that can still be estimated from the observed subsets.",
